{"id":"05-taget","level":"A1","title":{"sv":"En biljett till Stockholm","en":"A ticket to Stockholm","zh":"一张去斯德哥尔摩的票"},"scene":{"en":"Li buys a train ticket at the counter.","zh":"Li 在售票窗口买火车票。"},"vocab":[{"sv":"tur och retur","en":"return ticket (there and back)","zh":"往返票"},{"sv":"enkel","en":"single (one-way)","zh":"单程"},{"sv":"fönsterplats","en":"window seat","zh":"靠窗座位"},{"sv":"spår","en":"platform / track","zh":"站台 / 轨道"}],"lines":[{"who":"Li","sv":"Hej, jag vill köpa en biljett till Stockholm.","en":"Hi, I'd like to buy a ticket to Stockholm.","zh":"你好，我想买一张去斯德哥尔摩的票。","tokens":[{"t":"Hej","id":1162},{"t":", "},{"t":"jag","id":102},{"t":" "},{"t":"vill","id":129},{"t":" "},{"t":"köpa","id":398},{"t":" "},{"t":"en","id":93},{"t":" "},{"t":"biljett","id":2892},{"t":" "},{"t":"till","id":105},{"t":" "},{"t":"Stockholm"},{"t":"."}],"note":{"en":"“Jag vill köpa …” is direct but perfectly polite in Sweden.","zh":"“Jag vill köpa …” 说法直接，但在瑞典完全礼貌。"},"audio":"audio/05-taget/01.mp3"},{"who":"Säljare","sv":"Enkel eller tur och retur?","en":"Single or return?","zh":"单程还是往返？","tokens":[{"t":"Enkel","id":589,"v":"enkel"},{"t":" "},{"t":"eller","id":126},{"t":" "},{"t":"tur och retur","v":"tur och retur"},{"t":"?"}],"audio":"audio/05-taget/02.mp3"},{"who":"Li","sv":"Tur och retur, tack. Jag åker på fredag och kommer tillbaka på söndag.","en":"Return, please. I'm leaving on Friday and coming back on Sunday.","zh":"往返，谢谢。我周五走，周日回来。","tokens":[{"t":"Tur och retur","v":"tur och retur"},{"t":", "},{"t":"tack","id":903},{"t":". "},{"t":"Jag","id":102},{"t":" "},{"t":"åker","id":447},{"t":" "},{"t":"på","id":95},{"t":" "},{"t":"fredag","id":926},{"t":" "},{"t":"och","id":87},{"t":" "},{"t":"kommer","id":123},{"t":" "},{"t":"tillbaka","id":427},{"t":" "},{"t":"på","id":95},{"t":" "},{"t":"söndag","id":929},{"t":"."}],"note":{"en":"“På fredag” = on Friday; days of the week are not capitalised.","zh":"“på fredag” = 周五；星期名称不大写。"},"audio":"audio/05-taget/03.mp3"},{"who":"Säljare","sv":"Vill du ha en fönsterplats?","en":"Would you like a window seat?","zh":"要靠窗的座位吗？","tokens":[{"t":"Vill","id":129},{"t":" "},{"t":"du","id":134},{"t":" "},{"t":"ha","id":90},{"t":" "},{"t":"en","id":93},{"t":" "},{"t":"fönsterplats","v":"fönsterplats"},{"t":"?"}],"audio":"audio/05-taget/04.mp3"},{"who":"Li","sv":"Ja gärna.","en":"Yes, please.","zh":"好的，谢谢。","tokens":[{"t":"Ja","id":350},{"t":" "},{"t":"gärna","id":327},{"t":"."}],"note":{"en":"“Gärna” = gladly; “ja gärna” is the warm way to say yes to an offer.","zh":"“gärna” = 乐意；“ja gärna” 是热情接受的说法。"},"audio":"audio/05-taget/05.mp3"},{"who":"Säljare","sv":"Det blir fyrahundraåttio kronor.","en":"That's four hundred and eighty kronor.","zh":"一共 480 克朗。","tokens":[{"t":"Det","id":92},{"t":" "},{"t":"blir","id":122},{"t":" "},{"t":"fyrahundraåttio"},{"t":" "},{"t":"kronor","id":505},{"t":"."}],"audio":"audio/05-taget/06.mp3"},{"who":"Li","sv":"När går tåget?","en":"When does the train leave?","zh":"火车几点开？","tokens":[{"t":"När","id":138},{"t":" "},{"t":"går","id":144},{"t":" "},{"t":"tåget","id":1449},{"t":"?"}],"note":{"en":"Trains and buses “går” (go); people “åker” (travel).","zh":"火车和公交用“går”；人出行用“åker”。"},"audio":"audio/05-taget/07.mp3"},{"who":"Säljare","sv":"Kvart över åtta från spår tre.","en":"Quarter past eight from platform three.","zh":"八点一刻，三号站台。","tokens":[{"t":"Kvart","id":3800},{"t":" "},{"t":"över","id":176},{"t":" "},{"t":"åtta","id":80},{"t":" "},{"t":"från","id":127},{"t":" "},{"t":"spår","id":1252,"v":"spår"},{"t":" "},{"t":"tre","id":72},{"t":"."}],"note":{"en":"Time words: kvart över (quarter past), halv nio (half past eight!), kvart i (quarter to).","zh":"时间说法：kvart över（过一刻），halv nio（八点半！注意是“半到九”），kvart i（差一刻）。"},"audio":"audio/05-taget/08.mp3"},{"who":"Li","sv":"Hur lång tid tar det?","en":"How long does it take?","zh":"要多长时间？","tokens":[{"t":"Hur","id":157},{"t":" "},{"t":"lång","id":338},{"t":" "},{"t":"tid","id":183},{"t":" "},{"t":"tar","id":137},{"t":" "},{"t":"det","id":92},{"t":"?"}],"audio":"audio/05-taget/09.mp3"},{"who":"Säljare","sv":"Ungefär tre och en halv timme.","en":"About three and a half hours.","zh":"大约三个半小时。","tokens":[{"t":"Ungefär","id":670},{"t":" "},{"t":"tre","id":72},{"t":" "},{"t":"och","id":87},{"t":" "},{"t":"en","id":93},{"t":" "},{"t":"halv","id":1059},{"t":" "},{"t":"timme","id":525},{"t":"."}],"audio":"audio/05-taget/10.mp3"},{"who":"Li","sv":"Perfekt, tack!","en":"Perfect, thanks!","zh":"太好了，谢谢！","tokens":[{"t":"Perfekt","id":1801},{"t":", "},{"t":"tack","id":903},{"t":"!"}],"audio":"audio/05-taget/11.mp3"}],"series":"Basics"}